\# Python examples



Standard library only — no `pip install` needed.



\## Configuration



Set your bearer token as an environment variable:



```bash

export NETDOC\_TOKEN="your-bearer-token-here"

```



Or on PowerShell:



```powershell

$env:NETDOC\_TOKEN = "your-bearer-token-here"

```



Or edit the `TOKEN` constant at the top of each script.



\## Scripts



\- `list\_devices.py` — fetch and print all devices

\- `export\_inventory.py` — export the device list as CSV



Run with: `python list\_devices.py`


